<title>HUNGARY: Owner Blackburn continues to buy Fotex.</title>
<headline>Owner Blackburn continues to buy Fotex.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blackburn International, the biggest single shareholder of Hungarian retail chain Fotex Rt said on Wednesday it had bought 25,000 Fotex shares at 200 forints on July 14.</p>
<p>Panama-based Blackburn's announcement, released in the official bourse gazette, follows six other announcements this month that it had bought Fotex shares. Each purchase was between 10,000 and 27,000 units.</p>
<p>On Tuesday Fotex shares closed at 222 forints, up 22, on the Budapest Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
